KXS72CLBt4mUKlkzuRZKo9ayemnzmZWpFxtDEVWi_mT-rVpnnD1WPd8_6wP7JFMc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUC_ing3a8rmaKYIdX8PPspp_iTnFbtFrhWbbFbprhRvg&oe=6B0F09BB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Riftshot_Trailer_Cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "2481480689009413", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823351_2481480709009411_3096797329330793553_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zpVRkvGSZoQQ7kNvwEaY1t2&_nc_oc=AdpvhtNclEeBswOIjkqIS3I7zvcc1aPy2Z6d2hMvSivd6F3NGykS3maIG_DwArlXZBQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXHHx6lT9Pb6rQJfPnW7vYxr0ssGWo7p8gcCe8NH-oyWA&oe=6B0F2287"}, "display_name": "Riftshot: Room Zero", "keywords": ["aliens", "MR", "shooter", "defense", "robot"], "long_description": "In 2028 the Hollow begin tearing rifts into our world, and the first breach opens in your room: Room Zero.\n\nKIBO, an alien intelligence, arrives to stop them. Its directive is to protect: it can repair, scan and shield, but it can never strike. So it arms you. Aim your Phase Blaster through the rifts in your real walls and ceiling, take down the Hollow, then send KIBO to seal the walls they leave behind.\n\nA rift with an enemy firing through it is a threat: shoot it. A clear rift is a repair job: fix it. Keep that balance, or the breach spreads until reality in your room is overwritten.\n\nFEATURES\n- Rifts open on the real walls and ceiling you scanned in Space Setup.\n- 120 levels across a ten-year calendar campaign from 2028. Each level has 3 to 7 waves, and every December ends with the Maw.\n- Eight kinds of Hollow, from Gnawers that chew your walls to Snipers, Carriers that split, armored Shellbacks and stomping Brutes. Each needs its own answer.\n- KIBO at your side: it repairs, scans, shields and warns.\n- Upgrade cards between waves and a Combat Tree of permanent upgrades, all earned in play.\n- Replay levels to earn Scrap for cosmetic bullets, effects and kill coins.\n- One price. No loot boxes and no in-app purchases.\n\nFor Meta Quest 3 and 3S with Touch controllers. Played standing, in a room set up with Space Setup. No room scan? PLAY WITHOUT ROOM uses fallback walls.\n\nTentacle Maw model by Meshy (meshy.ai), CC BY 4.0 (creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0), modified.", "short_description": "The Hollow are tearing rifts into your real walls. Shoot back through them with your Phase Blaster, then send KIBO, an alien AI that repairs but never strikes, to seal the rifts you clear. Mixed-reality defense for Meta Quest 3 and 3S: 120 levels, and the Maw every December."}]}, "developer_name": "Time Illusion", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://timeillusion.com/riftshot/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "REMNANT DREAM S.R.L.", "support_website_url": "https://timeillusion.com/riftshot/#support", "website_url": "https://timeillusion.com/riftshot/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1521031996721534"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1147612421252462"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1438035257660002"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1438035257660002"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1